  "summary_insights": [
    "Revenue growth is marginal at +1.9%, constrained by regulatory approval delays in the UK building sector.",
    "Gross margin has compressed from 37.8% to 35.2%, driven by a 6.3% increase in cost of sales that outpaced turnover growth.",
    "Operating expenses rose significantly by 17.5%, reflecting heavy investment in systems and headcount for future scaling.",
    "Net profit has declined by 40.3% year-on-year, primarily due to the combination of margin pressure and increased overheads.",
    "The company remains financially resilient with a very high interest coverage ratio and a materially cash-positive balance sheet.",
    "Inventory levels have increased by 26.3%, which has attracted a qualified audit opinion and requires independent verification.",
    "A new D2C division was launched in FY26, contributing £159,776 to the top line as a new revenue stream."
